# Frontend Rules

- No frontend application is confirmed in this repository.
- Do not assume React, Vue, Angular, Vite, Webpack, a UI library, routing, state management, or styling framework.
- Before editing frontend files, locate and read the actual frontend root, package manager files, build config, and component directories.
- If a frontend project is added later, document its real framework and conventions before adding feature code.
- Keep API model naming aligned with backend semantics: DTO for inputs and VO for outputs.
